{"projectInfo":{"name":"OSPF快速重路由配置举例（交换）","path":"ospffast","visibility":2,"categoryId":6281,"introduction":"Switch A、Switch B和Switch C属于同一OSPF区域，通过OSPF协议实现网络互连。要求当Switch A和Switch B之间的链路出现故障时，业务可以快速切换到链路B上。","label":["OSPF","快速重路由"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"SWA","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWC","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWB","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWB.cfg"}]}